      "content": "we cleaned the plates and the fabric is super clean, no dust or anything obvious. we even swapped the paper and it still happens. it's like the color just... vanishes mid-press. is there any way the ink could be losing its pigment or getting pulled away during the heat cycle? like some kind of chemical interference or something?",
